<h1>Java Pet Store Lite</h1>
<p>Petstore Lite is a reduced version of the Java Pet Store Demo 1.3.2.
It keeps three capabilities: catalog browsing and search, sample data
population, and sign-on with access control.</p>
<p>To start using the demo, <a href="populating.jsp">enter the
store</a>. <i>If you are using this demo for the very first time, the
database is populated automatically.</i></p>
<p>Administrators can reload the sample data from the Admin page after signing in.</p>
